==Swedish==

===Etymology===
Corresponding to {{m|sv|och}} / {{m|sv|ock}} + {{m|sv|så}}, from {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|ok svā}}, from {{der|sv|non|ok}} and {{m|non|svá}}. Compare {{cog|da|også}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|/²ɔksɔ/}}
* {{IPA|sv|/²ɔsɔ/|q1=[[w:Scanian dialect|Scanian]], colloquial}}
* {{audio|sv|Sv-också.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{sv-adv|-}}
# [[too]], [[as well]], [[also]]
